.git
.gitignore
README.md
*.md.bak
plow-credentials
# Secrets: the live account #1 token lives in pinch-secrets.env, and any *.env is
# run-time-only (supplied via env_file / plow-agents env). Nothing COPYs them, but
# keep them out of the build context entirely so no secret can ever be baked.
pinch-secrets.env
*.env
